{"title":"Young Red Dragon","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 62 Dragon that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 35 times (1.4% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: breath: {\n            shape: {\n                kind: \"cone\",\n                rangeTiles: 6,\n                halfAngle: De\n            },\n            inhaleMs: 1e3,\n            cooldownMs: 12e3,\n            damageMult: 1.4\n        }</p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/young-red-dragon\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/young-red-dragon?lv=0\">Lv 0 <span>4,933</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/young-red-dragon?lv=56\">Lv 56 <span>550</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/young-red-dragon?lv=57\">Lv 57 <span>6,768</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/young-red-dragon?lv=58\">Lv 58 <span>6,708</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/young-red-dragon?lv=59\">Lv 59 <span>4,711</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/young-red-dragon?lv=62\">Lv 62 <span>95</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><t